      "side": 1,
      "message": "General comment for all structures: please add a short header to each structure member name, it makes using grep or cscope to find usage of any member easier. This is common practice in Ganesha code.\n\nEspecially avoid such common names as size, args, or glist.",
      "revId": "110655858a554265dcda4558a55508a4c6297bd8",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
